# Herbs-Co — Landing Page CMS

A small, content-managed landing page for **Herbs-Co**, a Zambian herbal wellness and perfume business.

- **Public site** (`index.html`) — hero, videos, gallery, about, products, steps, testimonials, FAQ, join form, contact links. Everything is driven by Supabase.
- **Admin CMS** (`admin.html`) — one logged-in admin edits all content, links, settings, and views submissions and analytics. No code changes needed.

Built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. No frameworks. No build step. Deploys to Vercel.

